; Kraken mini I2C waveform shifter (fits in 1 IMEM word; 8-word budget).
;
; Shifts 2-bit (SDA, SCL) samples from the OSR to uo[1:0]:
;   bit 0 → pin 0 (SDA), bit 1 → pin 1 (SCL)
;
; Use external 3.3 V pull-ups on SDA and SCL. The host precomputes line
; states (START, bits, ACK slot, STOP) and pushes bytes via the TX FIFO;
; each byte holds four (SDA, SCL) pairs. See i2c_encode.py.
;
; Host config: wrap 0..0, OUT_COUNT=2, autopull, pull_thresh=8 (full byte).

.program i2c_bitstream
.wrap_target
    out pins, 2 [7]
.wrap
